# Production / Default Client Environment Variables
# If deploying as a separate Frontend Static Site on Render:
# Set VITE_API_URL in the Render dashboard to your deployed backend URL (e.g. https://your-backend-service.onrender.com/api)
#
# If deploying as a single full-stack web service (where Express serves client/dist):
# Leave VITE_API_URL unset or empty so relative '/api' is used automatically.
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend-service.onrender.com/api
